    "detailed_description": "&quot;Gakuen Handsome Fighters&quot; is a single-player 2D action game. Characters from the 2010 romance adventure game &quot;Gakuen Handsome&quot; appear as dots in the game. Players fight using punches, kicks, and special moves.<br><br>Story<br>One day after school, the handsome boys of Rosemont High School play with a cat on the rooftop. However, the cat is kidnapped by a mysterious flying object. The handsome guys start to run to save the cat, but many monsters block their way along the way. Can they save the kitty?<br><br>Operation Methods<br>Directional key: Move<br>A key or X button: Punch<br>D key or B button: Kick<br>S key or A button: Jump, Decide<br>W key or Y button: Special move<br>Enter or START button: Pause, Decide<br><br>Game System<br>About Gauges<br>The heart-shaped gauge is the maximum strength (max. 6), and when it runs out, the player dies.<br>The star-shaped gauge is the number of special moves you can use (MAX is 2).<br>The number in the upper left corner is the number of remaining moves (max. 2), and the game is over when this number runs out.<br><br>About Special Moves<br>Special Moves can be used up to 2 times per stage. The number of uses can be restored with items.<br><br>About items<br>Pudding: Restores all the player's energy.<br>Dumplings: Restores the number of times a special move can be used.<br>Life: Restores all remaining units.<br><br>If the game does not start even if the system requirements are met, please refer to this page. <br>",
